From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TiogaPass <tiogapass@flax.local>
Date: Wed, 28 Feb 2024 17:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Default SEL enabled when globalenables D-Bus object missing

The AMI Global Enables setting object is not available on TiogaPass.
Default to SEL enabled instead of disabled when the property cannot
be read.

---
 log_manager.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/log_manager.cpp b/log_manager.cpp
index 1234567..abcdefg 100644
--- a/log_manager.cpp
+++ b/log_manager.cpp
@@ -453,7 +453,7 @@ void Manager::commit(uint64_t transactionId, std::string errMsg,
         catch (const sdbusplus::exception_t& e)
         {
             lg2::error("Failed to get D-Bus property:{ERROR}", "ERROR", e);
-            selEnabled = false;
+            selEnabled = true;
         }
         if (!selEnabled)
         {
